Package: bifrost-http
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31)
Maintainer: Bifrost Team <team@bifrost.dev>
Description: Bifrost AI Gateway — high-performance LLM gateway
 Bifrost is a high-performance AI gateway that unifies 20+ LLM providers
 behind a single OpenAI-compatible API with ~11µs overhead at 5,000 RPS.
 .
 Features:
  - 20+ LLM providers: OpenAI, Anthropic, Bedrock, Gemini, Groq, and more
  - MCP (Model Context Protocol) gateway — turns static chat models into agents
  - Streaming SSE with per-chunk hooks
  - Plugin pipeline (auth, rate-limit, caching, telemetry, governance)
  - Embedding, image generation, speech, batch operations
  - OpenAI/Anthropic/Bedrock SDK drop-in compatibility
  - Built-in web UI for management and monitoring
